---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Skip a Layer or Loop it? Test-Time Depth Adaptation of LLMs | AI/ML Deep Dives"
  description="CoLa finds the optimal layer sequence per input—skipping redundant layers, looping key ones—using MCTS. No training required. On LLaMA-3-8B-Instruct, it boosts DART-2 accuracy from 6% to 66% and often needs fewer layers to correct errors than to preserve correct answers."
  crumb="CoLa Depth Adaptation"
>

